      "writtenOn": "2022-01-09T14:13:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "As per AptX Adaptive spec description:\nTrue Wireless mode\nMultiple such mode exists.\nTWS-Stereo (or TWS-Legacy Stereo) is when a stereo stream is sent\nto a master sink and the master sink forward the stereo stream to a\nslave sink.\nTWS-Legacy Mono is when a stereo stream is sent to a master sink\nand the master sink forward a mono stream (left or right channel) to a\nslave sink.\nTWS+ is where a source sends a left channel to a “left” sink and a right\nchannel to a “right” sink \n\nwhile other are normal modes",
      "parentUuid": "71146cd5_c6c404f5",
